  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "In the adjoining figure, \\(ABCD\\) is a square, \\(ABE\\) is an equilateral triangle and point \\(E\\) is outside square \\(ABCD.\\) What is the measure of \\(\\angle AED\\) in degrees?",
